  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Better Than Sex Cake is a rich chocolate dessert layered with sweet flavor and irresistible texture. Moist cocoa cake is soaked in a smooth vanilla-infused syrup, then topped with fluffy whipped cream and crunchy toffee bits for the perfect balance of creamy and crisp. A hint of cream cheese adds extra richness, making every slice soft, sweet, and indulgent. Easy to prepare and always a crowd favorite, Better Than Sex Cake is the kind of dessert that turns any gathering into a special occasion.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-better-than-sex-cake\">Why You’ll Love This Better Than Sex Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-better-than-sex-cake\">How to Make Better Than Sex Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-better-than-sex-cake\">Pro Tips for Making Better Than Sex Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-better-than-sex-cake\">How to Serve this Better Than Sex Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-better-than-sex-cake\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Better Than Sex Cake</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Indulge in layers of rich chocolate and creamy goodness.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for any celebration or just a sweet treat at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, even for novice bakers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guaranteed to impress your friends and family with its decadent flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Each bite is a delightful experience that keeps you coming back for more!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12503\" class=\"wprm-reci